cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset in your research or trading tools, please cite it and star the repository."
title: "XAUUSD Tick Data 2025 — Free Gold Tick-by-Tick Historical Dataset (Complete Year)"
type: dataset
authors:
  - alias: Touhid-HZ
repository-code: "https://github.com/Touhid-HZ/xauusd-tick-data-2025"
abstract: >-
  Complete tick-by-tick historical data for spot gold (XAU/USD) covering the
  full 2025 calendar year (January 1 to December 31), sourced from Dukascopy
  Bank SA's public data feed. 71.4 million ticks with UTC millisecond
  timestamps, bid/ask prices and volumes, delivered as 53 weekly gzip CSVs
  plus daily OHLCV aggregates.
keywords:
  - XAUUSD
  - gold
  - tick-data
  - 2025
  - historical-data
  - dukascopy
  - forex
  - backtesting
  - quantitative-finance
  - dataset
  - metatrader
  - pandas
license: MIT
committers:
